994#issuecomment-2622641398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101994","id":2622641398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cUlT2","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-29T19:25:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:12:43Z","body":"Modified:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\t} else if (mip_image->get_format() == Image::FORMAT_RGB565) {\r\n\t\t// RGB565 to BGR565\r\n\t\tconst int64_t data_size = data.size();\r\n\t\tuint8_t *wb = data.ptrw();\r\n\r\n\t\tfor (int64_t i = 0; i < data_size; i += 2) {\r\n\t\t\tuint16_t px = wb[i] | (wb[i + 1] << 8);\r\n\r\n\t\t\tuint8_t r = (px >> 11) & 0x1F;\r\n\t\t\tuint8_t g = (px >> 5) & 0x3F;\r\n\t\t\tuint8_t b = px & 0x1F;\r\n\r\n\t\t\tuint16_t out_px = (b << 11) | (g << 5) | r;\r\n\r\n\t\t\twb[i + 0] = out_px & 0xFF;\r\n\t\t\twb[i + 1] = (out_px >> 8) & 0xFF;\r\n\t\t}\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2622641398/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https